  "description": {
    "raw": "With a single primal howl, you strike fear in your opponents. Until the end of the spell’s duration, you treat those affected by it as if they were your favored enemy, gaining a +2 bonus on weapon attack and damage rolls against them, and a +2 bonus on Bluff, Knowledge, Perception, Sense Motive, and Survival checks against them. If an affected creature is already one of your favored enemies, it is shaken instead. This is a mind-affecting fear effect.",
    "search_text": "\"with a single primal howl, you strike fear in your opponents. until the end of the spell’s duration, you treat those affected by it as if they were your favored enemy, gaining a +2 bonus on weapon attack and damage rolls against them, and a +2 bonus on bluff, knowledge, perception, sense motive, and survival checks against them. if an affected creature is already one of your favored enemies, it is shaken instead. this is a mind-affecting fear effect.\"",
